abstract: "Archived inputs, configurations, analysis scripts, tests, tables and figures for BERT/SQuAD training energy labels and a ShuffleNet-v2/CIFAR-100 control under four contextual profiles. Protocol 0.2 preserves the original results and adds explicit selection comparators, stricter sample-level admissibility, shifted-start sensitivity and median imputation. No new training or field validation is claimed."
